# Dependencies and local-only artifacts.
#
# NEVER add runtime source directories (lib/, api/, scripts/, public/) or any
# individual module here. A require()d file that git does not track is missing
# from the deployment and crashes on a serverless cold start, while the build
# still reports success. `npm run verify:modules` fails the build if that ever
# happens again.

node_modules/

# package-lock.json is deliberately TRACKED. This is a payment system: the
# exact dependency tree that passed CI must be the one that deploys. Leaving
# it untracked let `npm install` resolve different transitive versions in CI
# and in production.
.env
.env.local
.vercel
*.log
.DS_Store
